<!-- The modified arm as actually built — this is what every bring-up in this
     repo loads by default.

     Parallel to open_manipulator_x_robot.urdf.xacro (which now describes only
     the EARLIER state of the arm, kept for A/B comparison). Identical mounting,
     namespace, gazebo and ros2_control plumbing, but the arm macro comes from
     open_manipulator_x_custom.urdf.xacro — re-clocked forearm, vertical-axis
     joint4 and the claw gripper, all extracted from AM_xfwd.usda. Joint and
     link names are unchanged, so every controller config and both ground
     stations work as-is. The wrist_mount_pitch_deg arg of the older file does
     not exist here; that geometry is part of the baked meshes. -->
